\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，魔防提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，受到魔法伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，魔防提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，受到魔法伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"守誓之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/40px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/60px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/80px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：80<img alt=\"守誓之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/40px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/60px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/80px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，三级：180<img alt=\"守誓之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/40px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/60px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/80px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"1\">可习得该极限解放的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%9B%E5%89%91%E7%9B%BE%E5%85%B5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/王国军剑盾兵\"><img alt=\"头像 王国军剑盾兵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/02/7gpnzfvbspx6lr0hl35uc2h8qmuiip8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">王国军剑盾兵</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%89%E8%BE%89%E5%8D%AB%E5%A3%AB%E2%80%9C%E9%AD%94%E7%A6%81%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/光辉卫士“魔禁”\"><img alt=\"头像 光辉卫士“魔禁”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e8/65pwfu123ydc4ex